# Leaf rule: a Dockerfile with no HEALTHCHECK. Maps to trivy DS-0026 /
# checkov CKV_DOCKER_2. Runs standalone and as a composite leaf.
# @see docs/adr/ADR-009-composite-rules-and-facts.md
# @implements ADR-009.composite
id: KEUR-IAC-003
maturity: 2
title: Dockerfile has no HEALTHCHECK
category: iac
severity: info
engine: absence
action: advisory
confidence: 0.4
target:
  filenames: Dockerfile
patterns:
  - regex: (?im)^\s*HEALTHCHECK\s
    message: "Dockerfile has no HEALTHCHECK — orchestrators cannot tell if the container is healthy. Add a HEALTHCHECK instruction."
fix: "Add a HEALTHCHECK instruction so the runtime can detect an unhealthy container."
